# Whole-document text dumps, ~490 kB each and regenerated by the commands in
# results.md. The per-page extracts that the findings actually rest on
# (ours-p29.txt, ours-p30.txt, ref-p29.txt, ref-p30.txt) are tracked instead.
#
# ours-noquirk.txt and ours-quirk.txt are additionally a VOID measurement and
# must not be banked as evidence: they were taken with the Sep-17 binary, whose
# assembly contains no WordParity at all, so XRAY_OFFICE_LIBREOFFICE_QUIRKS=1
# changed nothing and the two files are identical by construction rather than
# by finding. results.md section 0 records the discard.
ours-noquirk.txt
ours-quirk.txt
ref.txt
